  "version": "enrolled",
  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending Code 18.2-308.5:1): \"Auto sear\" means a device, other than a trigger activator, designed for use in converting a semi-automatic firearm to shoot automatically more than one shot, without manual reloading, by a single function of the trigger.+}\nSec. 1 (amending Code 18.2-308.5:1(B)): It is unlawful for any person to manufacture, import, sell, offer for sale, possess, transfer, or transport[- a-]{+ an auto sear or a+} trigger activator in the Commonwealth.\nSec. 1 (Code 18.2-308.5:1(C)): A violation of this section is punishable as a Class 6 felony.\nSec. 1 (amending Code 19.2-386.28): weapon{+, auto sear, or trigger activator is+} concealed, possessed, transported{+,+} or carried in violation of §",
